## Templates

A template is a full-page composition of existing components, shown in a shared stage. Templates exist only in these docs and are not importable components.

### App shells

- [Shell](/en/template-shell): An app shell with a sidebar, command palette, notifications, and a dashboard.
- [Launcher](/en/template-launcher): A keyboard-first, CoreBox-style launcher with a live preview.
- [Settings](/en/template-settings): A settings center with sectioned navigation and rows that save as you go.
- [Onboarding](/en/template-onboarding): A five-step first run through sign-in, a workspace, preferences, and permissions.
- [Workbench](/en/template-workbench): A plugin workbench with a file tree, a code editor, a terminal, and a hot-reload preview.
- [Account](/en/template-account): Profile, security, sessions and notifications, with confirmed removal.

### Content

- [CMS](/en/template-cms): A content admin with status filters, bulk actions, and a drawer editor.
- [Gallery](/en/template-gallery): A showcase wall with collections, three layouts, and artwork details.
- [Inbox](/en/template-inbox): A three-pane inbox with keyboard shortcuts and new-mail alerts.
- [Files](/en/template-files): A file manager with a folder tree, multi-select, a context menu, and drag-in upload.
- [Store](/en/template-store): A plugin store with featured picks, search, permission details, and install flows.
- [Docs](/en/template-docs): A help center reader with a contents tree, outline, and ⌘K search.
- [Notes](/en/template-notes): A notes app with a notebook tree, WYSIWYG editing, and live collaboration.
- [Showcase](/en/template-showcase): A release page that tells one update through a motion headline, a card carousel, and metrics.
- [Search results](/en/template-search): A search results page with filters, paging, and an empty state.

### AI apps

- [Agent chat](/en/template-agent-chat): A coding agent session with a write gate, live plan, and changed files.
- [AI answer](/en/template-ai-answer): A multi-turn Q&A with streamed answers, numbered citations, and follow-ups.
- [Research](/en/template-research): A research copilot with its process, numbered citations, and an evidence rail.
- [Voice notes](/en/template-voice): Voice notes that transcribe while recording and turn the recording into a summary and to-dos.
- [Image studio](/en/template-image-studio): An image generation studio with style controls, generating placeholders, and a full-size viewer.

### Data & flow

- [Dashboard](/en/template-dashboard): A product analytics board with KPI cards, a trend chart, and a plugin table.
- [Automation](/en/template-automation): An automation editor with a flow canvas, node settings, and a run log.
- [Release](/en/template-release): A release console from CI build to a staged rollout a person approves.
- [Experiments](/en/template-experiments): An experiment board that compares training runs by curves, a hyperparameter sweep, and configs.
- [Kanban](/en/template-kanban): A four-column task board with drag, keyboard moves and a drawer.

